1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,299
Sticky cabinets?

2
00:00:01,532 --> 00:00:03,888
That's cooking grease mixed with dust.

3
00:00:04,179 --> 00:00:05,212
Don't scrub it.

4
00:00:05,503 --> 00:00:06,559
Do this.

5
00:00:06,767 --> 00:00:07,300
One.

6
00:00:07,591 --> 00:00:10,251
Wipe off loose dust with a dry microfiber

7
00:00:10,261 --> 00:00:12,489
cloth, from the top down.

8
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,372
Two.

9
00:00:13,664 --> 00:00:16,162
Wipe with warm soapy water on a damp

10
00:00:16,172 --> 00:00:18,377
cloth, then wait a minute.

11
00:00:18,567 --> 00:00:19,251
Three.

12
00:00:19,798 --> 00:00:23,222
Wipe with plain water, and dry right away.

13
00:00:23,884 --> 00:00:26,705
Use baking soda paste on thick spots.

14
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:28,629
Full guide on the channel.
